"""A spelling-based detector of middle, membership, and relative position.

It responds most strongly to 中 ('middle/in') and its Korean counterpart 중.
Compounds ending in 中 are weaker; China and center words weaker still.
English middle/central/medium and among/after have smaller responses.
Two-token constructions distinguish spatial 'in between' from relational
'relationship between', and retain a response on 'center of'. This is a
lexical approximation, not a general semantic parser. Other tokens get zero.
