"""Recognize source/link labels, with separate arc and stopping-word responses.

src and href give large negative activations, scaled by case and attached
punctuation. Other resource, directory, and code-attribute labels are weaker.
Opening a quoted value immediately after src/href is weakly negative too.
The arc words arc/arcs/弧 and the spelling rc form a separate negative family;
selected English/Chinese stopping words are positive. A space-slash is positive,
stronger after cd/find and weaker after numbers. All other tokens predict zero.
Only the previous token is remembered, resetting at document boundaries.
